q5BMt22YqCgQ7kNvwEM81GE&_nc_oc=AdrV7K_S7vIeIUnGtdB_V_RFOObsaPvlrqruymX20yVxbwaPKpWpEl5vD9i0PssoGcM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7-vri_HXBZ_va93O55GyzuTNxPnOpC4Y8vSBo8J_Y1LQ&oe=6A1C4237"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VKbrcvhBKkcQ7kNvwHF6Zn9&_nc_oc=AdogJG-zl9xBP2Rxdmhx0R53Jb7uTr6N6SY-8oLL1otjK_WfugU84N7sHgqeQOqJbj8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7l-t7ajwF7kPozCPiQy5AVdQlXtomiK4m-x97X9raXcg&oe=6A1C43CA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=U1lTeAFu9ZsQ7kNvwFBPZQG&_nc_oc=AdrbhYBFushcNa-Xftus7JLTBwsK9dm3v33U_4We0-jiXiHijvc5s-B58euMMmhNBJc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4-g3ilT9VRNFlJLnkCFT5zbekQVxxlxSVWUdmdpCKDsw&oe=6A1C30EF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Rw13-JcVUzwQ7kNvwHKLHbb&_nc_oc=AdobikhHBg1a7mn7zj-oWgtiIqGKRA7qEDsMNpVI-UEN_4PD87Lh01cqbfRwPEgWDHk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4WDyXy3_Z2E9M05xufrmyRxklneZDpVIHNRgfn82oecA&oe=6A1C5283"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3h4bPtqnvdAQ7kNvwGPgEiJ&_nc_oc=AdqDTyVoDe_CcrOqnQAWX_-dZ-2aXnotW3kwvfJgmBBuo8ID4grlopXIpvdHD7mdz9o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6V2NjdqQXllJt7tGq4lwElpgRGm4hTNw8slYuPZbalyw&oe=6A1C4AD8"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dmh13o6H3lEQ7kNvwHSbvC7&_nc_oc=Adq4oEfz040JwaI-T_zMFefPgjtcWN3RCJ1Wi142ZrgjTc8LKI4IVbcpGfQgfVSCQ0c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5K8KB1r2X_4_GpYW5n-ccGa8CXvZP1_wA9T2fSUv3_dg&oe=6A1C5DFC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080